.DS_Store

# Full dataset — fetched by scripts/download_data.py
data/full/

# Runtime state
data/pending/
data/app.db
data/app.db-wal
data/app.db-shm

# data/insights.json is deliberately NOT ignored: it is generated from the full
# 8,000-image dataset (which is), so it cannot be regenerated from the
# committed sample without contradicting its own interpretation text. Committing
# it also means the Insights page works on a fresh clone with no setup step.

# Retrained model versions produced at runtime
models/coffee_model_*.keras

# models/best.weights.h5 is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the best-checkpoint
# artifact the notebook produced, and it carries exactly the weights inside
# coffee_model.keras (verified identical).

# locust/results/ is deliberately NOT ignored: the CSVs are the raw evidence
# behind the flood-request table in the README.

# Secrets
.env
.env.*

